  "title": {
   "en": "Muchuude Tsunagaru Gozen 4-ji ~Oni Joushi to Maiban Iku made Dekiai H?!~"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "夢中でつながる午前4時～鬼上司と毎晩イクまで溺愛H!?～"
   },
   {
    "en": "Entangling in Dream at 4:00 A.M.: Making Love Every Night with My Mean Manager Until I Come!?"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "\"Don't think about anything, just feel me...\"\n\nIf you continue to be given such a sweet stimulus like a dream, I'll love you... These days, Miu, who works for a design company, is troubled by a naughty dream. What's more, the other person is Kawanami, her highly competent senior.\n___\nMiu's greatest dream is to become a designer. After moving away to escape her stalker ex-boyfriend, she now works at her dream company under the strict 'demonic' boss, Kawanami. Miu admires Kawanami's work ethic, but sometimes the man is just too overbearing. Though Miu has other problems, her recent dreams mostly involve getting steamy with Kawanami, and she's sure it was all because of that dreamy matchmaking bracelet! Wait, Kawanami has the same dreams, too?",
   "ja": "「ここでは余計なこと考えねえで、俺のことだけ感じとけ・・・」こんな夢みたいな甘い刺激を与えられ続けたら私・・・好きになっちゃうよ―――デザイン会社で働く実羽（みう）の近頃の悩みは、エッチな夢をみてしまうこと。しかもその相手は・・・仕事はできるけど超厳しい職場の先輩・河南（かわなみ）。普段は怖くて近寄り難い先輩だけど、夢の中では甘い言葉で溺愛してきて・・・？「お前がかわいくて仕方ねえんだよ・・・逃げねえんなら、最後まで止めてやれないからな」これは夢？現実？先輩の触れる指先が、中で動く舌が、熱くて、キモチよくて、何も考えられないっ・・・"
  },
